cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mhdturbFoam-hardened, please cite this archived release and the upstream works listed in the references and in the NOTICE file."
title: "mhdturbFoam-hardened: a corrected redistribution of the FOSSEE mhdturbFoam turbulent MHD solver for OpenFOAM 6"
abstract: >-
  A hardened redistribution of the FOSSEE mhdturbFoam solver for incompressible
  turbulent magnetohydrodynamic flows in OpenFOAM 6, in the full
  magnetic-induction formulation inherited from OpenFOAM's mhdFoam. Three
  numerical defects of the upstream derivative are corrected: the outer PISO
  corrector loop is restored (so that the pFinal dictionary is actually
  reached), the singular pB Poisson problem of closed or fully periodic domains
  is given a reference cell, and fvOptions are coupled into the momentum
  equation so that meanVelocityForce can drive a periodic channel. This is a
  derived work: the physical formulation is not original and all upstream
  projects are credited in the NOTICE file.
